cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the manuscript and the archived release."
title: "A Bayesian Threshold-Crossing Joint Model for Irregular, Assay-Floor-Censored Molecular Monitoring in Chronic Myeloid Leukemia — analysis code"
abstract: >-
  Code, Stan models and reproducible simulation workflow for a Bayesian joint
  model in which deep molecular response is read as a first-hitting time of the
  latent biomarker trajectory rather than coded as a separate event, with
  assay-floor left-censoring and interval-observed endpoints. Includes the
  ADEMP simulation study, prior-sensitivity, leave-one-out model comparison and
  simulation-based calibration analyses, and a synthetic-cohort generator that
  allows the pipeline to run without access to the confidential clinical data.
